  "prefLabel": "Ncr 844.08 Winter Trail Grooming Operations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 844.08 Winter Trail Grooming Operations. Applicants applying for winter grooming operations shall include the following to be submitted with the “Winter Snowmobile Application for Grant-in-Aid”, 2025 June:\n\n(a) A trail map;\n\n(b) The total one-way mileage of trails to be groomed;\n\n(c) A detailed description of the grooming equipment and implement to be used including the make, model, and size;\n\n(d) A certificate of good standing, if not already on file with the bureau; and\n\n(e) A certificate of insurance, if not already on file with the bureau.\n\nSource. #14293, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr800.html"
